# scripts/opcount: `ratelimitbench bench window N` makes N takes of one
# token from fixed windows of 10 tokens per 10ms, over 64 keys, 10µs apart
# (ST1); the cost of one take is the slope between the two sizes.
unit take
sizes 200000 1200000
args bench window {n}
control benchmarks/ratelimit/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/ratelimit/testdata/floor
